```

3. Now we will create a Sox object to process audio:

```java
Sox sox = new Sox();
try {
    sox.setSource(new FileInputStream("input.wav")); // set the input audio file
} catch (FileNotFoundException e) {
    System.out.println("Error: Input file not found.");
    return;
}
