4. We will then loop through our input audio files and apply their respective weights:

```java
for (int i = 0; i < inputs.length; i++) {
    try {
        sox.addBoth(-3d); // adjust volume (-3d for -12dB)
        sox.setSource(new FileInputStream(inputs[i])); // set source to current input
