- The right to expect goods to last a reasonable length of time without breaking down.
- The right to be informed about the price of the goods, any related services, and how much VAT will be charged.
- The right to reject goods that are not as described, defective, or not fit for purpose within a "reasonable time" after purchase.
- The right to claim a repair, replacement, or refund

