add_action('init', function() {
    add_filter('wp_headers', function($headers) {
        $headers['Access-Control-Allow-Origin'] = '*';
        $headers['Access-Control-Allow-Methods'] = 'GET, POST, OPTIONS';
        $headers['Access-Control-Allow-Credentials'] = 'true';
        $headers['Access-Control-Max-Age'] = 86400; // 1 day
        return $headers;
    });
});
```

This will allow any origin to access your API endpoints and enable the required methods (GET, POST, OPTIONS). It also sets the maximum age of the preflight cache to 1 day.

